      </h2>

      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div class="bg-cream/10 border border-cream/20 rounded-2xl p-8">
          <h3 class="font-sans font-semibold text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-cream/40 mb-6">Before</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-4">
            {[
              'Waking up exhausted',
              'Afternoon energy crashes',
              'Bloating after every meal',
              'Mind racing at 2am',
