          name="Max Paul Franklin"
          role="Asheville, NC"
        />
        <TestimonialCard
          quote="For 19 years, I sought answers for multiple <strong>neurological conditions</strong>. I saw dozens of doctors, acupuncturists, dietitians, surgeons, physical therapists. Then I found Ramesh. In <strong>6 days, all my neurological pain was gone</strong>. I mean, gone."
